{"id":"wb-7-1666","name":"关东州厅旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"关东州厅旧址","text":"关东州厅旧址，位于中华人民共和国辽宁省大连市旅顺口区友谊路59号，是一处两层欧式建筑。该建筑最早为俄罗斯帝国所建，日俄战争为日本所占，先后成为日本关东都督府、关东厅、关东州厅所在地。中华人民共和国成立后，此处被中国人民解放军接管，后曾一度闲置。2013年，关东州厅旧址被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%B3%E4%B8%9C%E5%B7%9E%E5%8E%85%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":89466989,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89466989","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/57b11cdcf8193d087c5c69e0.jpg","title":"关东州厅旧址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%85%B3%E4%B8%9C%E5%B7%9E%E5%8E%85%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1c/%E5%85%B3%E4%B8%9C%E5%B7%9E%E5%8E%85%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ffggss","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​关东州厅旧址","width":320,"height":240}}